Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:08.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,《绿巨人浩克》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:28.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（水母免疫系统）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:30.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（绿色生物萤光）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:33.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（异常快速反应）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:27.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（诱发性细胞游走）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.70,0:02:39.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（再生能力的遗传基础）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:41.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发现DNA片段）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:45.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我企图制造人类再生能力）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:52.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（再生即是永生）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:06.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（组织硬化）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:08.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（防御功能）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:11.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（灵长类动物实验）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.90,0:03:15.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（猴子死亡 基因改造失败）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:17.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（因毒素致死）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:19.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中和毒性）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:22.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（关键物种）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:39.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蜥蜴/抗毒性）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:42.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最高毒性质）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.30,0:03:52.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（继续灵长类动物实验）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能抵抗每一种化学武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's simply no way to shield against every weaponized agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我能加强人体细胞反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, I can make super-immune systems…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造出超级免疫系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}by strengthening the human cellular response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,班纳 我知道你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banner, I know where you're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但改造免疫系统既危险又愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But manipulating the immune system is dangerous and stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统的科学顾问说得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The president's science advisors made it absolutely clear…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准进行人体实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}no human subjects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:53.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1967年6月25日）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:56.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（基因改造有进展）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 我有好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, I ha wonderful news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:57.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（基因遗传）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:02.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我遗传给他什么？）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 布鲁斯 你要恐龙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bruce, do you want dinosaurs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大战一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a littM fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't scare me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好吃的眼球 你是可怕的绿怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a delicious eyeball. Ooh, you're big and green and scary. I'm gonna run away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:26.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我最大的恐惧成真了）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:29.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一定要找到解药）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 接谢丽尔 猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, speaking of Cheryl, guess what…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, you're hurt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小杰打他 布鲁斯没还手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack hit him with the stick, but Bruce wouldn't hit him back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是站着一直发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just stood there, shaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好怪哦 他一声也不吭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, strange he didn't make a peep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:08:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般小孩会哭得死去活来 布鲁斯就是这么地… 压抑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other kid would 've wailed his head off. That's Bruce. He's like that. He's just so… bottled up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在实验室找到人类血液样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}The samples we found in your lab… they were human blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违反了规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've ignored protocol{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无权干涉我的实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had no right snooping around in my lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了 这是政府公事 你不准再做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong, Banner. It's government business, and you're off the project.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,全员注意 故障安全系统启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, all personnel Fail-safe has been initiated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,半小时后清除伽玛辐射污染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gamma decontamination will occur in 30 minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuate immediately!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重覆 立刻撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, evacuate immediately!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊蒂 - 大卫 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Edith? - David, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.10,0:09:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得谈谈 伊蒂 - 布鲁斯 留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta talk to you, Edith. - Bruce, stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.20,0:09:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你刚刚发生了什么！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to tell you what has to be done.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, please stop it.! No.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.! No.! Yes.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}David.! No.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 快醒醒 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce. Bruce, wake up, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce. Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又做了噩梦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another nightmare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要去上大学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already off to college.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna miss you terribly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.30,0:10:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你 你会成为伟大科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you. Soon to be a great scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.10,0:10:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁知道呢？- 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, who knows? - I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上有什么…很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something inside you… so special{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种很了不起的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of greatness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天你会让全世界知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure someday you're gonna… share it with the whole world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:12:00.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（柏克莱核能生化科技研究所）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得保全应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as far as I'm concerned, security oughta be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 柯兹勒博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Good morning, Dr. Krenzler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该要加强保全 这种地方一定要格外小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security oughta be beefed up. In a place like this you can't be too careful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是今天了 你有没有睡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce.! Big day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是睡不着 我睡得还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you sleep? I didn't sleep. I slept okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.00,0:12:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂在吗？在啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Betty here? She's around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 你的头盔有够时髦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really gotta say, seeing you in that stylin' head wear…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嫌我的安全帽很丑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're implying something about my helmet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活像个呆瓜 谁也没你逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like a massive nerd, even around other scientists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被她甩掉那天也戴这玩意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I just ask… Were you wearing the helmet while she dumped you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它保护我的金头脑 哈普\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, it protects my very important brain, Harper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,去准备样本吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go prep the samples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我找到你了 - 嗨 贝蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. I found you. - Betty, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨死他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚到 你说谁？审查委员会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I just got here. Who do we hate? The review board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼拜二要提案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to make a presentation on Tuesday. Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:12:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要跟我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna make it with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I should? Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事你最在行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're great with that stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有谈到微生物和奈米微生物 才会稍微有点…热情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start talking about microbes and nanomeds, you sound almost… passionate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这话太伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. That was rude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人说一起工作很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, nobody expects this to be easy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我们从前是那么…亲密\N{\fnArial\fs30}us working together after being… so close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有亲密过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were close?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我更…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if I could be more…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.40,0:13:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.40,0:13:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…just… Don't. It's not your fault. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫我老是找性情冷淡的男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a by-product… of my inexplicable obsession with emotionally distant men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.10,0:13:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天我会释怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get over us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次审查让我很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I'm just really stressed about this review.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天没有好的成果 礼拜二就很难说服他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't get impressive results today, we're gonna have a really hard sell come Tuesday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去干活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, let's go be ilepressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈普？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好了就开始 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready when you are. Let's hit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,安检合格吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we passing inspection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全都没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safeties all going green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数计时开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Countdown's started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:57.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（释出奈米微生物）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:14:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈米微生物释出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nanomeds released.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,四秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.10,0:15:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈米微生物完全释出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, nanomeds fully dispersed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 替小佛照伽玛射线吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's hit Freddie with the gamma radiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:26.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发射伽玛射线）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射伽玛射线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gamma exposure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈米微生物开始活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nanomeds now active.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈米微生物在伤口处复制细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nanomeds replicating cells on border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,细胞修复和损坏误差值 维持在百分之一内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell copy to disassemble ratio holding within one percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:16:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈米微生物活动失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imbalanced nanomed activity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想跟审查委员说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna go to the review board on Monday and tell 'em…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发明杀青蛙的新方法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've developed a brand-new method for exploding frogs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 这一定有市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think maybe there's a market for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞不好会发生瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what if there's a plague?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才喝一罐啤酒就醉了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you had, Betty, like, one beer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说要是青蛙从天而降\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just sa… I'm just saying, you know, frogs start falling from the sky, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要去找谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who do they come to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定会一炮而红\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be world-renowned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母一定会很骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make any parent proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸妈一定以你为傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents must be proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是希望我当科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}They actually did want me to be a scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你的亲生父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your birth parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we'll never know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么一直不想知道他们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand why you don't want to find out about them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:17:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们早就死了 我什么都不记得他们就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead. They died before I can remember anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么一直要追问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you always come back to this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.40,0:17:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你的内心一定有什么秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I figure there's more to you than you like to show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能天生就这么冷淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess there couldn't be any Mss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕了半天又回到老问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So now we come full circM back to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glen. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么没穿军服？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your uniform?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我换了工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I, uh… I switched over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是替你父亲做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still working with your father, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过民间包商的工作更有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, the military's subcontracting out all the most interesting work, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,高薪也令人无法抗拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't argue with a paycheck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:18:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责基地所有的实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I basically run all the labs on the base now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're looking good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是遗传工程专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the genetics expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！大学时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the good old college days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how's business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就直话直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll cut to the chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你的研究工作很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been hearing interesting things about what you guys are doing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的分子机器有很多用途\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little molecular machines have some incredible implications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不如到亚矽工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you like to come work for Atheon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,薪水比你现在多十倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get paid 10 times as much as you earn now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.60,0:18:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也能拥有专利权\N{\fnArial\fs30}and own a piece of the patents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说一个字就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to say the word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个字 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two words: the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军？\N{\fnArial\fs30}General{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶柏要你看这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talbot wanted you to see this, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚矽想买下一间实验室 搬到沙漠基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about a lab Atheon is targeting for acquisition and removal to desert base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么不去找国安局？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why isn't it going through N.S.C.?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟你女儿有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It, uh, concerns your daughter, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.10,0:20:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,班尼呢？他不值大夜班啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what happened to Benny? Is he not working the night shift anymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.50,0:20:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是新来的工友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the new guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会了 彼此彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to meet you. Same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再拍一张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, no. Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我很累\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilook tired anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you look great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在做噩梦 好可怕哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's these dreams, Doctor. I keep having them, and they're terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.20,0:20:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about your dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始只是一个记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it starts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一个记忆 那是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it starts with a memory… I think it's my first memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,两岁大看到的景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this image I have…from when I was maybe two years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不只是个梦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think it's just a dream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.20,0:21:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这件事发生在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think it's something that happened…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟我爸住的沙漠基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was living at a desert base with my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.60,0:21:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场梦继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dream goes on and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.10,0:21:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我突然只有一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}suddenly I'm alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.50,0:22:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'd never hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.50,0:23:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.50,0:23:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What 's your name, darlin'{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.50,0:23:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh? What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.20,0:23:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.30,0:25:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta talk to you, Edith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.30,0:25:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, stay here.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.20,0:26:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.30,0:27:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.80,0:27:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,早 葛伦来拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Glen dropped by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.20,0:27:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑来干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.30,0:27:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Dr. Krenzler, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.10,0:27:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直没正式认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and I have never had the chance to get to know each other properly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.10,0:27:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,正式或非正式我都不想认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's because I don't want to get to know you, properly or improperly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.20,0:27:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Mave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.20,0:27:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no worries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.40,0:27:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you a little heads-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.70,0:27:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,善意收购和恶意并构\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a hairsbreadth between friendly offer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.30,0:27:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一线之隔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hostile takeover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.30,0:27:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做过功课 你们的研究工作很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done my homework. The work you're doing here is dynamite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.30,0:27:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think: Gls embedded with technology…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.70,0:27:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国大兵拥有自我疗伤的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}that makes them instantly repairable on the battlefield. …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.90,0:27:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,专利权在我们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}in our sole possession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.10,0:28:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是门赚钱的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a hell of a business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.80,0:28:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们的目的 我们只是做科学研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not what we're doing here. We're doing the basic science for everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.80,0:28:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天我要写一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, someday I'm gonna write a book…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.10,0:28:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,穷科学家的愚蠢理想\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna call it When Stupid Ideals Happen To Smart, Penniless Scientists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.10,0:28:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会再见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, Bruce, you will be hearing from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛伦的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Glen, I, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.90,0:28:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.80,0:28:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想说别担心 我会处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to say, don't worry about him… I'll handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.30,0:29:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么处理？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打给我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'le gonna call my father, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.50,0:29:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他施加压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}ask him to exert some pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.60,0:29:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你爸不是不说话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I heard, you and your father weren't speaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.00,0:29:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我们现在有话可说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess now I have something to talk with him about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.10,0:29:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,电线好像短路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this circuit's kinda fried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.10,0:29:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe you wanna come take a look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.10,0:29:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll be right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.00,0:29:42.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发射伽玛射线）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.30,0:29:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,伽玛射线量太高了 我停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gammas too high.! Bruce, I can 't stop it.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.70,0:29:56.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发射）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.40,0:29:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈普 快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harper, get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.10,0:30:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.50,0:30:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈普没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Harper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.50,0:30:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.50,0:30:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.50,0:30:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他暂时不敢回实验室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's coming back to the lab for a while, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.10,0:30:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand how this is possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.40,0:30:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该没命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.40,0:30:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了 奈米微生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They worked… the nanoleeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.10,0:30:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I feel great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.10,0:30:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们把我的伤势治好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like… I don't know. They must have, like, fixed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.00,0:31:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们杀死所有的实验对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, they've killed everything else that they've come into contact with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.60,0:31:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生有没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure the doctor checked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.60,0:31:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他替我做过全身检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor gave me the full workup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.00,0:31:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想知道我吃了什么仙丹灵药\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to know where he can get what I'm taking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.90,0:31:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的元气百分百\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a hundred percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.00,0:31:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,比百分百更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.00,0:31:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.90,0:31:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的膝盖不是受过伤吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember my bad knee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.40,0:31:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在完全好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now it's my good knee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.80,0:31:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, this isn't funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.40,0:31:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你 你差点没命 我得眼睁睁看着你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was watching you. You were gonna die, and I was gonna have to watch you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.10,0:31:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.80,0:31:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.50,0:31:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.20,0:31:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会爆炸啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm not gonna explode. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.80,0:31:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.00,0:31:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm fine. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.40,0:31:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没这么好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never felt better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.10,0:33:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字不是柯兹勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name is not Krenzler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.00,0:33:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.60,0:33:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你原姓班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Your name… it's Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.30,0:33:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯班纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.00,0:33:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.70,0:33:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么进来的？我在这儿工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get in here? I work here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.40,0:33:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在实验室值大夜班\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the labs. The late shift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.40,0:33:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才能接近你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps me close to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.30,0:33:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟罗小姐都工作到很晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always work so late yoursel with your friend Miss Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.70,0:33:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Please. Please. Let me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.60,0:33:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受了伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.90,0:33:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发生严重的意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had a terrible accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.70,0:33:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想你为什么没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wondering why you're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.00,0:33:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上一定有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're thinking there's something inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.00,0:33:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something different…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.30,0:34:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法解释的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}inexplicable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.70,0:34:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你了解它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you understand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.70,0:34:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you'll let me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.40,0:34:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你肯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll. …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.40,0:34:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.30,0:34:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位先生 我不知道我要原谅你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, mister, I'm sure I have nothing to forgive you for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.60,0:34:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}So perhaps you should leave now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.60,0:34:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.60,0:34:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.60,0:34:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not want to believe it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.00,0:34:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从你的双眼看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can see it in your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.80,0:34:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们跟你母亲的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much like your mother's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.40,0:34:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然是我的亲生骨肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you're my flesh and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.20,0:34:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你也是别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, you're something else too, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.40,0:34:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My physical son, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.70,0:34:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我的心血结晶\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the child of my mind too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.40,0:34:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.40,0:35:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候父母就双亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents died when I was a small boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.80,0:35:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 这是他们编的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, that's not true. That's what they wanted you to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.80,0:35:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次实验和意外是最高机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The experiments, the accident… all top secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.20,0:35:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被关了三十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}They put me away for 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.30,0:35:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,整整三十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty years!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.80,0:35:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.00,0:35:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away from our work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.20,0:35:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不能关我一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they couldn't keep me forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们得承认我没发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, I'm sane. They had to admit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.60,0:35:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.30,0:35:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.40,0:35:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年来你费尽心思\N{\fnArial\fs30}your extraordinary mind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.70,0:35:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been seeking all these years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.80,0:35:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在你的体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's been inside you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.30,0:35:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们要了解它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we will understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.60,0:35:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌控它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will harness it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.10,0:35:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别接 一定是罗小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't answer it. It's Miss Ross again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.40,0:35:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道她一件事 令人不安的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something you need to know about her, Bruce. Something troublesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.90,0:35:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me protect you from her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.60,0:36:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.30,0:36:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布鲁斯 - 出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bruce… - Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.70,0:36:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.20,0:36:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别乱发脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to watch that temper of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.90,0:37:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的没事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you're okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.90,0:37:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 能起床真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just gl to be out of bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.10,0:37:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到我爸的留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a message from my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.70,0:37:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.70,0:37:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father? Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.70,0:37:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,几时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.50,0:37:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一小时后到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lands in about an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.50,0:37:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的是 他先打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The funny thing is, he called me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.30,0:37:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 爸爸 哈罗 贝蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dad. Hello, Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.20,0:37:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, maam. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.20,0:37:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome. Sir? Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.70,0:37:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.60,0:38:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就直话直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm gonna get right to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.20,0:38:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟葛伦有关 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Glen, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.80,0:38:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他鬼鬼祟祟跑来我实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been snooping around my lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.20,0:38:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看到一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glen noticed some things, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.80,0:38:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以请我来收购一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}asked me to make some inquiries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.40,0:38:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.40,0:38:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,质问我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}question me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.60,0:38:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.00,0:38:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现一些令人惊讶的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've turned up some surprising things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.40,0:38:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同事柯兹勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This KrenzMr you work with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.70,0:38:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他的真实身份吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know who he really is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.50,0:38:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底对他了解多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you actually know about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.40,0:38:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the question is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.40,0:38:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他了解多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is it that you know about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.60,0:38:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我未经授权… - 你未经授权不能向我透露\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, right now, I'm not… - Not at liberty to disclose it to me. Right. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.80,0:38:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.80,0:38:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I was hoping that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.80,0:39:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe this time you just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.60,0:39:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真的想见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}honestly wanted to see me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.10,0:39:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你误解了 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've got this all wrong, Betty. - Do I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.70,0:39:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我是真的想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I do want to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.10,0:39:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望能相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really wish that I could believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.80,0:39:43.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（柯兹勒血液样本）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.60,0:40:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年来你费尽心思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.70,0:40:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}your extraordinary mind has been seeking… all these years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.70,0:40:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在你的体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's been inside you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.10,0:40:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是柯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, you've called Dr. Krenzler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.70,0:40:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留言 我会尽快回电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please lea a message and I'll call you right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.20,0:40:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 你在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, hey. Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.40,0:40:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把事情搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, um, I think I screwed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.90,0:40:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸…他怀疑你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father… It 's like he suspects you of something. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.50,0:40:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太没耐心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so impatient, like always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.70,0:40:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hear him out. I don't know, I- - {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.70,0:41:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像在打实验室的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think that they're planning something with the lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.00,0:41:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.10,0:42:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室发生骚动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatch! Dispatch! We have a 415 at the lab!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.10,0:42:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快派警察过来 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send Berkeley P.D. now! Send 'em now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.60,0:44:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edith? David, what 's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.10,0:44:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得谈谈 - 布鲁斯 留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta talk to you, Edith. - Bruce, stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.40,0:45:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的好儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.70,0:45:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.20,0:46:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室发生爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was some sort of explosion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.70,0:46:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不让我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wouldn't let us into the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.60,0:46:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was worried about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.10,0:46:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.40,0:46:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.00,0:46:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一场好真实的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had the most vivid dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.70,0:46:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就像婴儿呱呱落地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like being born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.70,0:46:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,探出头来透气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming up for air. Light hitting my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.70,0:46:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,光亮迎面而来 我大声嚎叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏猛烈跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heartbeat…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.10,0:46:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直怦怦响\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was, like, boom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.70,0:46:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在实验室吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you at the lab?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.70,0:46:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.00,0:46:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有什么在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.40,0:46:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was that man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.40,0:47:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,牵着狗的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one with the dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.40,0:47:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.80,0:47:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,新来的工友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That new janitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.60,0:47:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他是我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.00,0:47:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.50,0:47:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.20,0:47:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, my.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.20,0:47:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你就是布鲁斯班…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is the young Bruce Ban…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.60,0:47:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯兹勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krenzler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.60,0:47:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚你在实验室掉了东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you left something in your lab last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.60,0:47:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,米契 送我女儿出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mitchell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.40,0:48:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我待会就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escort my daughter outside. I'll join her shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.90,0:48:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.30,0:48:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.70,0:48:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.70,0:48:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.70,0:48:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好他 我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him under observation. I'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.60,0:48:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Your friend in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.70,0:48:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能被扯进一些危险的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a good chance he's caught up in some very bad business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.50,0:48:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些未了的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfinished business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.50,0:48:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要查清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I promise you, I'm gonna get to the bottom of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.70,0:48:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证会好好照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my word I'll make sure he's cared for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.70,0:48:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起他被软禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as of right now, he is incommunicado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.70,0:48:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几天你最好离他远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the next few days at least, you're gonna stay away from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.20,0:48:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your own good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.60,0:49:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新工友的住址？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and that's for the new guy on the night shift, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.30,0:49:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Thank you. I appreciate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.60,0:49:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.70,0:49:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}How unexpected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.70,0:49:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.10,0:49:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉冒昧拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to just show up at your house like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.80,0:49:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来请教一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to ask you something that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.30,0:49:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我无权过问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really have no business asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.60,0:49:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟你说了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.20,0:50:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你跟他谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you talked to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.20,0:50:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.60,0:50:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯昨晚在实验室 他说你也在 他不太记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce was at the lab last night. He said that you were there too. But he can't remember much about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.50,0:50:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to find out what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.80,0:50:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you want to know, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.80,0:50:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有哪里不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's wrong with him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.80,0:50:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后设法救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can fix him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.00,0:50:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他治好改变他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cure him, change him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.30,0:50:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲是将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's with the military.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.80,0:50:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为他对国家安全造成威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems to think he's involved in some kind of threat to national security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.80,0:50:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲…罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father. Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.30,0:50:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把你爸找来对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought your father down upon his head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.20,0:50:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么也不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}How little you understand, Miss Ross, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.20,0:50:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的无知也会造成极大危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how dangerous your ignorance has become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.80,0:51:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉？别道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Don't be sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.10,0:51:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son is… unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你无法了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you can't relate to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.60,0:51:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他与众不同 这世界容不下他的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because he is unique, the world will not tolerate his existence. Will they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.40,0:51:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.10,0:51:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}you try, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.80,0:51:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.80,0:51:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.10,0:51:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这种大美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a very beautiful woman like you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.70,0:51:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定无法抗拒你的魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}your attentions can't be completely unwanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.20,0:51:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.00,0:51:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.40,0:51:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用水汪汪的大眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with eyes like yours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.80,0:51:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满爱意地看着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching expectantly, lovingly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.40,0:52:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是想帮助他已经来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm afraid we're both too late to help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.40,0:52:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我都不能为他做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing I can do for him or for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.90,0:52:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.20,0:52:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他表明不想跟我扯上关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's made it clear he wants nothing to do with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.00,0:52:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}His choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.00,0:52:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我失陪 我要去忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you'll excuse me, Miss Ross, I have some work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.80,0:52:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕那些狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't worry about the dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.20,0:52:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.60,0:52:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你不瞪着它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't look 'em in the eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.20,0:52:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.10,0:52:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才出来一个月实验室就出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets released, and a month later your lab is destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.70,0:52:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.90,0:52:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他人在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're not gonna tell me where he is, are ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.70,0:52:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很想帮忙 但我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to tell you? I'd like to help you, but I just don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.40,0:52:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am. Right, Banner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.70,0:52:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是高阶将领 贝蒂的父亲 少装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Betty's father. You're a high-ranking general Let's cut the crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.30,0:52:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是把你爸关起来的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the guy who had your father tossed away, and a lot more like him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.10,0:52:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有必要我也会把你抓去关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll do the same with you if I feel so disposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.40,0:53:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把他关起来 别问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand? If you had him tossed away, then why are you asking me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.30,0:53:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也不记得 我只知道我爸死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember. I was always told my father was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.80,0:53:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't play with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.60,0:53:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到那一切都四岁大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were four years old when you saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.00,0:53:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I saw what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.40,0:53:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也在场 怎么会不记得？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right there. How could anyone forget a thing like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.50,0:53:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.50,0:53:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,被压抑的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, some more repressed memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.60,0:53:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.40,0:53:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.90,0:53:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的情况比我想像的更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an even more screwed-up mess than I thought you'd be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.40,0:53:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在查清楚之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we get to the bottom of this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.40,0:53:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的实验室成为机密军事用地\N{\fnArial\fs30}your lab has been declared a top-secret military site…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.00,0:53:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有资格回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're not gonna get a security clearance to get back into it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.90,0:53:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能到任何实验室工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}or any other lab that's doing anything more interesting than…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.50,0:53:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你只是研究最新草本发胶\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to figure out the next generation of herbal hair gel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.50,0:53:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.80,0:54:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你敢再靠近我女儿一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever come within a thousand yards of my daughter again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.50,0:54:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把你抓去关一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put you away for the rest of your natural life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.00,0:54:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dogs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.00,0:54:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go get her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.00,0:54:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让任何人挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let nothing stand in your way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.00,0:54:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.50,0:55:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想用同样的方法把你除掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, they think they can just throw you away as they did me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.80,0:55:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么了？你对我做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with me? What did you do to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.50,0:56:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天有一个访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a visit today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.50,0:56:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不受欢迎的访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very unwelcome visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.00,0:56:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是逼不得已的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid my hand is being forced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.60,0:56:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底对我做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.90,0:56:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很想知道 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You so much want to know, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.90,0:56:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是再多的解释也比不上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think no explanation will serve you half as well..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.10,0:56:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲身的体验\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.80,0:56:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,何况我自己也不是很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, I still don't quite understand it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.60,0:56:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我只想好好做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they'd only let me work in peace…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.60,0:56:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们却不放过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, my betters would have none of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.90,0:56:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿自己做人体实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you experimented on yourself, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.90,0:56:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把什么遗传给我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And passed on to me… what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.50,0:56:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种改造基因\N{\fnArial\fs30}An alteration. Genetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.20,0:56:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你可以说那是种畸形吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deformity. I guess you could call it that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.50,0:56:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是也拥有无穷力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}But an amazing strength too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.20,0:56:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在它被释放我就能加以利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, finally unleashed, I can harvest it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.30,0:56:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You'll do no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.30,0:56:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把它找出来进行治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will isolate it and treat it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.70,0:57:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁它没造成伤害杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll remove it and I'll kill it before it does any real harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.20,0:57:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你的贝蒂一定很想毁了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet you and your Betty would love to destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.20,0:57:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你能毁了你自己吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But would you really destroy part of yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.50,0:57:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.10,0:57:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于贝蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as for Betty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.10,0:57:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经派我的忠犬去拜访她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending her a surprise visit…from some four-legged friends of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.70,0:57:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我培养了你的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I managed to culture some of your very own DNA, Bruce, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.30,0:57:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,效果真的很惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the results are tremendous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.00,0:57:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不稳定 但是力量强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're unstable, but very powerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.20,0:57:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的DNA怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my DNA?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.40,0:57:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,先看看贝蒂觉得怎么样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just wait and see what Betty makes of the results, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.60,0:57:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.60,0:57:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.60,0:57:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off of me. Talbot, what's this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.50,0:57:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚进去 我要跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside, asshole. I wanna talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.80,0:57:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲去找贝蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, my father's going after Betty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.80,0:57:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟敢背着我找罗斯对付我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think you can go behind my back and get Ross to cut me out, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.20,0:57:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 贝蒂有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me! Betty's in trouble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.90,0:58:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这可怜的怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pathetic freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.30,0:58:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂会被杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty's in danger. I swear to you, she'll be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.30,0:58:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can state the obvious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.80,0:58:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有资格来威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tells me you aren't in much of a position to be making stupid threats to anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.60,0:58:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶柏？干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talbot. Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.80,0:58:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹我生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making me angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.80,0:58:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, am I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.80,0:59:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.! Open fire.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.80,1:06:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他派变种狗来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sent these dogs, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.20,1:06:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我宰了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I killed them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.50,1:07:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是因为奈米微生物和伽玛射线\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God. It must be the nanomeds. It must be the gamma exposure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.80,1:07:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们没见过这种效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've never seen any effect like this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.20,1:07:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 另有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Deeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.20,1:07:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伽玛射线触发了某种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gamma just unleashed what was already there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.30,1:07:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unleashed what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.50,1:07:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.50,1:07:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.30,1:07:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Shh. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.40,1:07:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些动物是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were those animal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.20,1:07:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸派来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father sent them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.30,1:07:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的是我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.10,1:07:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted me to change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.20,1:07:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我变成可怕的绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted me to change into that mindless hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.60,1:07:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he want that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.20,1:07:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you remember anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.50,1:08:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你改变时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything from when you were changed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.60,1:08:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像一场梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.50,1:08:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦里有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.80,1:08:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.30,1:08:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.90,1:08:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.20,1:08:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.90,1:08:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.00,1:08:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty! Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.50,1:08:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好害怕 我需要你的帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared. I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.30,1:08:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.70,1:09:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.10,1:09:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吧 我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.40,1:09:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的愤怒启动了奈米微生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that somehow your anger is triggering the nanomeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.20,1:09:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会？它们对肉体伤害才有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could it? We designed them to respond to physical damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.70,1:09:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神伤害也会引起生理反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emotional damage can manifest physically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.20,1:09:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.50,1:09:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,严重的心理创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serious trauma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.50,1:09:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,被压抑的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repressed memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.90,1:09:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸逼问我小时候发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father grilled me about something that happened to me from early childhood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.90,1:09:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我应该记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I'm supposed to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.30,1:09:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.80,1:10:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很严重 但是我真的不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounded bad, but… I honestly don't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.10,1:10:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最担心的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing that worries me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.70,1:10:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉体伤害有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}a physical wound is finite, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.90,1:10:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神伤害却是难以衡量\N{\fnArial\fs30}but with emotions, what 's to say it won't just go on and on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.70,1:10:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能引起连锁反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}and start a chain reaction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.50,1:10:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我最害怕什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what scares me the most?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.00,1:10:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我开始改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it happens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.20,1:10:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我无法抗拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it comes over me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.40,1:10:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全失去控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I totally lose control{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.20,1:10:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.40,1:10:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱住你了 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I got you. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.30,1:11:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事 这只是麻醉枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be okay. It's just to make you sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.00,1:11:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标倒下 目标被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target down. Target secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.00,1:11:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带你到安全地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to take you someplace safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.90,1:14:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,立正 继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention on deck. Carry on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.30,1:14:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被我们埋在地底深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're buried out here in the middle of nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.20,1:14:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算把他关多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long are you gonna keep him sedated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.10,1:14:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有必要关一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the rest of his natural life, if I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.50,1:14:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我可以相信你 我是你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I could trust you. I'm your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.00,1:14:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会做我认为是对的事 而不是你要我做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can trust me to do what I think is right, not what you think you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.40,1:14:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个人 - 他也是别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He is a human being. - He is also something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.50,1:14:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他逃出去 在大城市发飙怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppose he gets out, has one of his little mood swings… in a populated area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.50,1:14:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他很危险 但是他也救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm aware of the potential danger. I'm also aware that he saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.80,1:14:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他替你痛宰一只变种贵宝狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, from a mutant French poodle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.30,1:14:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真该对他感激涕零\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm indebted to him for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.60,1:14:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也把三个人打伤 陶柏也瘸了腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also put three men in a hospital and Talbot's barely walking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.30,1:14:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎样？- 我要你帮助他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want me to do? - I want you to help him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.60,1:14:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么这么怕他？- 我了解他的出身\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why is he such a threat to you? - Because I know what he comes from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.50,1:15:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上每一个分子都跟他爸一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is his father's son, every last molecule of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.80,1:15:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他不认识他爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he doesn't know his father, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.30,1:15:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们却进行相同的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's workin'in the same exact goddamn field his father did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.80,1:15:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不是说谎那就更可怕 因为他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either he's lyin'… or it's somethin' worse, and he's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.20,1:15:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.30,1:15:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,命中注定追随他父亲的脚步？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Predestined to follow in his father's footsteps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.50,1:15:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想说他受了诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna say "damned".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.50,1:15:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.10,1:15:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为科学家我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm a scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.60,1:15:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能找出原因帮助他\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a scientist, I believe we can figure this out and he can be helped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.20,1:15:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.60,1:15:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, whether you know or care, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.10,1:15:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都以你的工作为荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a lot of pride in what you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.80,1:15:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这件事太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is too big for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.90,1:15:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道政府想利用他当武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know the government thinks they have a weapon on their hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.00,1:15:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然他早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, he'd be dead by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.60,1:15:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们大可以对他为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can probe and prod all they want, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.50,1:15:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是也让我帮助他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the meanwhile, just let me try to help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.80,1:16:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人比我更了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows him better than I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.60,1:16:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫班纳对他做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did David Banner do to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.30,1:16:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护左翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover left! Clear left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.30,1:16:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护右翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.00,1:18:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.90,1:18:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.30,1:18:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子DNA的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, the strength of my son's DNA…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.20,1:18:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,结合奈米微生物的再生能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}combined with nanomed reconstruction…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.00,1:18:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我能溶入任何物体的本质\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I can partake with the essences of all things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.80,1:18:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你把手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna have to ask you to put your hands up, pal okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.40,1:18:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.70,1:19:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really believe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.90,1:19:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是分开的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I am separate from you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.70,1:19:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.60,1:19:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.90,1:19:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信我们住过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to believe we used to live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.50,1:19:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定见过你 甚至认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have seen you or known you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.50,1:19:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我记得起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only I could remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.10,1:20:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我老家 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my old house, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.60,1:21:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.40,1:21:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着回想一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.60,1:22:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.80,1:22:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.80,1:22:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.20,1:22:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dalen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.40,1:22:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你想知道什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Betty… what do you want to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.80,1:22:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那间房间有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was in that room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.60,1:22:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕我会看到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you afraid that I'll see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.40,1:23:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? There's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.30,1:23:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,空无一物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.40,1:23:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么不能见他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, I don't ha access to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.60,1:23:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,国安局决定把这个威胁 交给亚矽公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}NSA has decided to turn over study of the, uh… the threat to Atheon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.70,1:23:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是基地指挥官 你能作主\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're head of the base. I thought you were in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.80,1:23:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不了决策 只能服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't set policy, and I still take orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.80,1:23:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信陶柏竟然出卖我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe Talbot would go around me like this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.20,1:23:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多有权有势的人都想插一脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's a lot of powerful people that want in on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.00,1:23:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以赚很多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And money to be made… lots of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.20,1:23:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道最糟的是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the worst part about all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.50,1:24:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我把父亲关起来把儿子送走\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I had David Banner locked up and sent that kid away, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.70,1:24:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只把他当成一般受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't give that boy a second thought; he was just collateral damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.90,1:24:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不再是了吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he isn't anymore, is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.40,1:24:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.40,1:24:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go home now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.90,1:24:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想让你跟他道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd tell you to go and say good-bye, but I've already been informed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.10,1:24:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我奉命不准他和外界联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}that for now all further contact is out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.30,1:24:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.20,1:25:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 你好吗？这儿的饭好不好吃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Bruce. How ya feelin'? Grub okay in here for ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.40,1:25:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.10,1:25:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.50,1:25:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的细胞触发化学反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I need your cells to trigger some chemical distress signal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.30,1:25:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你变成那个绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, so you can turn a little green for me again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.30,1:25:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把真正的你大卸八块\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can carve off a piece of the real you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.60,1:25:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,分析后申请专利赚大钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}analyze it, patent it, make a fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.80,1:25:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.50,1:25:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never let you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.80,1:25:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure you've got much of a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.20,1:25:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不生气吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Bruce. Aren't you feeling a little angry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.60,1:25:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂弃你不顾 只有我陪你玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, you've only got me to play with now that Betty's dumped you and gone back to Berkeley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.20,1:25:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.30,1:25:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是双赢的局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for me this is a win-win situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.30,1:25:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你变成绿巨人乖乖等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turn green, and all these guys come in and kill you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.70,1:25:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我进行解剖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I perform the autopsy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.60,1:26:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.80,1:26:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就海扁你一顿 掐断你脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I mop the floor with you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.80,1:26:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很不科学\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe by accident go too far and break your neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.80,1:26:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是却让我很爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad science, maybe… but personally gratifying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.00,1:26:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 看你有什么能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Bruce! Let's see what you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.20,1:26:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.40,1:26:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许能用意志力控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, consciously you may control it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.80,1:26:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你却控制不了潜意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}but subconsciously, I bet that's another story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.10,1:27:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺激他的脑波吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's jump-start those brain waves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.30,1:27:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.20,1:27:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的罗小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Miss Ross{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.80,1:27:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.70,1:27:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有两名守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two guards right outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.50,1:27:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我没生你的气 我不再生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry. I'm not angry with you. Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.60,1:27:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.10,1:27:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这一生已经完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over for me now. I know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.40,1:27:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯也快完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And soon it'll be over for Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.10,1:27:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I've come to you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.50,1:28:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你说服你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ask you if you could persuade your father, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.90,1:28:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他以一个父亲的角度考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a man, as a father himself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.70,1:28:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意乖乖自首\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if I turn myself in now, peacefully…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.40,1:28:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他把我关一辈子之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and before he puts me away forever, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.00,1:28:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他让我见我儿子最后一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he would let me see my son…for one last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.60,1:28:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我这个忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you do that for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.90,1:28:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我爸也不能作主\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out of my father's hands now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.30,1:28:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 他也成为傀儡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand. He's a puppet now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.00,1:28:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怪他 你是不能怪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame him. You shouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.30,1:28:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该怪你对你儿子做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should blame yourself for what you've done to your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.10,1:28:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what have I done to my son, Miss Ross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.90,1:28:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有 我只是试着突破自己的极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I tried to improve on the limits in myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.40,1:28:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我自己 不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myself!. Not him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.70,1:28:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能了解吗？违反自然定律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you understand? To improve on nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.40,1:28:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,增进自我的知识能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}My nature! Knowledge of oneself!.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.50,1:29:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是追求真理唯一的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only path to the truth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.90,1:29:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人类挣脱上帝的束缚\N{\fnArial\fs30}that give men the power to go beyond God's boundaries!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.50,1:29:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不能为了自己牺牲别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's beyond your boundaries? Other people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.00,1:29:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只为布鲁斯带来恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you've given Bruce is fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.30,1:29:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对生命的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.20,1:29:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.50,1:29:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps, Miss Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.60,1:29:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}And loneliness too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.10,1:29:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,两者我都经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes… I feel them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.40,1:29:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我也曾拥有幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have lived… completely once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.60,1:29:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深爱我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so much in love, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.30,1:29:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也很想要一个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she so much wanted a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.40,1:29:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.00,1:30:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一怀孕我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could tell from the moment she conceived…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.90,1:30:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是个儿子 是别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it wasn't a son I had given her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.40,1:30:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.30,1:30:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该结束他的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should ha put a stop to it right then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.70,1:30:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我很好奇 那也是我的沉沦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was curious and that was my downfall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.20,1:30:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我看着小生命逐渐成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as I watched this tiny life unfold, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.30,1:30:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就想到他长大后会有多痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I began to imagine the horror of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.60,1:30:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的好奇心被慈悲心取代\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my curiosity was replaced…with compassion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.70,1:30:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们不让我治好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they took away my chance to cure him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.20,1:30:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲把我关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father threw me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.40,1:30:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么 - 那一天我记得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I remember that day so well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.00,1:30:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一刻每一种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}every moment, every sensation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.40,1:30:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走进屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}walking into the house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.40,1:30:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,手里拿着刀的触感\N{\fnArial\fs30}the feeling of the handle of the knife in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.90,1:31:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身为父亲必须结束他的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I was doing a father's work, fulfilling a father's mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.60,1:31:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, please stop it.! No.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.20,1:31:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, no.! Talk to me.! Listen.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.30,1:31:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她让我吓一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then she surprised me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.20,1:31:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.! No.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.10,1:31:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.20,1:31:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和那把刀好像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was as if…she and the knife…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.00,1:31:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,合而为一\N{\fnArial\fs30}merged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.20,1:31:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.80,1:31:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法想像我有多绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot imagine… the unbearable finality of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.00,1:31:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那一瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in that one moment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.50,1:31:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我夺走我所爱的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took everything that was dear to me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.90,1:31:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,心中一片空虚 剩下痛苦回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and transformed it into nothing more…than a memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.70,1:32:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 他做了可怕的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo! That must be some jumbo nightmare he just had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.70,1:32:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手 开始抽取酵素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, do it now. Start the enzyme extraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.70,1:32:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, negative on drill penetration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.10,1:32:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就用力 使用全力 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, drill him harder! Give him full RPMs. Come on, Holeman! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.90,1:32:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了他吗？- 不 杀了他就没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should I neutralize? - No! I can't do anything with goop! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.50,1:33:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他麻醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, put him to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.00,1:33:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not stopping him.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.00,1:33:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出我们的危机小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready room, send in our containment team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.00,1:33:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用非致命武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non-Mthals only. I repeat, non-lethals only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.60,1:33:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要采到他的样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have a sample of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.10,1:33:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.20,1:33:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 用泡沫喷他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus! - Hit him with the foam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.20,1:33:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,强力化学泡沫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deploy containment foam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.20,1:33:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶柏 快回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talbot, talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.30,1:33:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制住了 有必要再通知你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease fire! Under control General I'll let you know if we need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.20,1:33:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我要你马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unacceptable. Unseat your asses down here immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.90,1:33:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,全员撤退 终止你的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a full-court evacuation now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.70,1:33:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全面封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm shutting you down. Lockdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.40,1:34:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听到将军的话？我说全面封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you hear what the general said? I said lockdown!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.70,1:34:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 我要他的样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear! I need a sample of him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.20,1:34:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy there, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.60,1:34:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能会有点痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might give you a bit of a sting here, Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.50,1:34:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back! Fall back! Clear your weapon! Clear it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.20,1:34:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下去 给我M2弹 永别了 绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the M2. So long, big boy. Clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.90,1:34:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻全面封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lockdown the entire facility immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.90,1:34:53.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（全面封锁）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.20,1:34:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标移向蓝层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target's still moving towards blue level{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.70,1:34:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把大厅疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuate the main hall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.90,1:35:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人带重型武器进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send in backup, heavy weapons. Issue general quarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.70,1:35:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全员备战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set firing lines Mft and right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.40,1:35:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,重型武器 准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavy weapons, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.90,1:35:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统发出警讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contamination, sir. System readings are redline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.10,1:35:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,辐射污染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data's on backup power supply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.30,1:35:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.10,1:35:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断大厅电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut down all power to the main hall. Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.00,1:36:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他出去 到外面对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him the way out. We'll fight him outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.20,1:38:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driver, stop. Driver, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.20,1:38:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,炮兵 炮管向右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunner, trarse left.! Trarse left.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.40,1:39:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,回复 回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear back! Clear back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.50,1:40:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生 我有坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. President, I have some bad news, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.80,1:40:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have it, General{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.80,1:40:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统知道代号「怒汉」的事 我猜是这件事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've briefed the president on Angry Man. I assume that's what this is about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.10,1:40:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我要求行使作战指挥权\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, ma'am. I'm requesting a National Command Authority override.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.90,1:40:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,「怒汉」失去控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angry Man is unsecure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.80,1:40:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要动用所有武力阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need everything we have at my disposal in order to stop his movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.30,1:40:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会造成老百姓伤亡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're expecting civilian casualties, General{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.30,1:40:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽全力阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if I can help it, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.60,1:40:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意 继续报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it done. Keep us posted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.10,1:41:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知古曼基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact Goodman Control{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.10,1:41:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,调派战斗直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patch data to the assets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.60,1:41:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,连络总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact H.Q.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.50,1:41:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他们立刻疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have them initiate an immediate evacuation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.50,1:41:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,座标653-216区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}in vicinity of grid coordinates 653-216…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.70,1:42:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请确认该区完全疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm that the area has been cleared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.00,1:42:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,该区已疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm area cleared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.50,1:42:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,并锁定目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.Q. confirms area cleared. Assets on-line, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.50,1:42:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 进攻吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, it's time to dig in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.80,1:42:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要目标停止行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want this target stopped in his tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.90,1:43:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.00,1:43:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救！求救！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday! Mayday! Ah, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.30,1:43:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,探戈四号被打落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tango Four is down. Ha C-SAR respond to our 20 ASAP.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.30,1:43:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出搜救小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send a search and rescue team.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.50,1:43:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把他引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay, but, damn it, get him off us before he tears us apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.70,1:43:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打不到他 你能瞄准吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got no shot. Do you ha a clear line of fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.60,1:43:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, Tango Flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.80,1:43:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快向左飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break left.! Break left.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.30,1:44:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要发射地狱火飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tango Three, pull back and set up for a Hellfire shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.30,1:44:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们把他引开再发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire till we draw him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.40,1:44:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,探戈一号准备开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tango One is hot. Gun wazzed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.70,1:44:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 准备发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger. Going hot. Guns ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.30,1:44:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engage at will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.60,1:44:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 让我发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tango One, pull back.! Clear my line.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.70,1:44:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 我瞄准目标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tango Flight, clear back. I've got him painted for Hellfire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.70,1:44:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开火吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. Tango One clear. Take the shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.40,1:45:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我射中他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tango One, Tango Three. I ha contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.60,1:45:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他接到我的飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit! He's got my missile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.10,1:45:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday! Mayday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.50,1:45:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救 我被击落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday! Mayday! We're hit! We're going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.00,1:45:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有人伤亡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a head count. Tango Three, give me a sit rep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.70,1:45:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机被击落 无人伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our kite's busted up, but we're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.50,1:45:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到目标吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tango Flight, do you ha eyes on the target?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.10,1:45:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在岩石堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tango One. I ha him in the rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.20,1:45:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力开火 把它移为平地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salvo all Turn it into a parking lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.70,1:46:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被移为平地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-bolt, your parking lot is ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.30,1:46:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,油量不够 返回基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bingo for fuel and ammo. R. T.B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.10,1:46:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官 目标没被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-bolt, this is Goodman Control{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.30,1:46:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又在移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be advised, target not destroyed. He's on the move again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.00,1:46:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.00,1:46:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.50,1:46:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears he's heading home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.70,1:46:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,出动战机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch fast movers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.80,1:46:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦截目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha them intercept and engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.40,1:46:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.70,1:46:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty, Bruce got out. He's headed your way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.10,1:47:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他往你那儿去 大概是去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and probably right for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.20,1:47:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离基地多远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far from the base are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.60,1:47:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到了 他们把他爸带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm already here. They're taking his father in now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.80,1:47:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好消息 待在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That 's all good news. Stay there, Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.90,1:47:13.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（旧金山 柏克莱）
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.50,1:47:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,传奇一号和二号急速接近中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend One rolling in hot. Legend Two breaking offleft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.50,1:47:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要折回来进行攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can come back around for a gun attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.60,1:47:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准目标就开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acquire a clear target. Fire at will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.30,1:47:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是民航机 快爬升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Increase altitude. Civilian aircraft in vicinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.10,1:47:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拉高 你会撞到大桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up.! Pull up.! You're headed for the bridge.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.70,1:47:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拉不高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't pull up! I can't pull up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.90,1:48:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他载到大气层外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you've got him now. Take him on a ride to the top of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.30,1:48:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他吸不到空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what the thin air will do for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.30,1:48:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动后燃引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiating afterburner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.00,1:48:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬升到六万英尺高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm passing flight level 600.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.10,1:48:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到了极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is out of my envelope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.40,1:48:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there, Legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.50,1:48:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抓得太紧 无法维持高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't maintain. He's all over my aerodynamics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.40,1:48:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会比你先昏过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll lose consciousness before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.80,1:48:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,九万五千英尺 我撑不下去了 我要下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine-fifty. I can't hold it. I'm pulling back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.70,1:49:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑微的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Puny human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.60,1:49:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坠入大海 准备开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact. He's in the water. All units, weapons hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.40,1:49:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not take any chances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.90,1:49:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are cleared to fire on target, Legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.20,1:50:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad? Betty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.40,1:50:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择 一定要消灭他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a choice. I have to destroy him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.60,1:50:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么做 把他激怒只会让他更强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't. You will only fuel his rage, and you will make him stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.60,1:50:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是去找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you he's coming for. You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.20,1:50:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let me go to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.70,1:50:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.30,1:50:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他机会冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give him a chance to calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.00,1:51:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧金山领空的民航机\N{\fnArial\fs30}All aircraft vicinity of San Francisco, this is T-bolt on guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.40,1:51:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这区域是飞行禁区\N{\fnArial\fs30}This area has been declared restricted airspace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.80,1:51:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有飞行物必须立刻撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}All aircraft are ordered to clear the airspace immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.20,1:51:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定目标 准备开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echo, One-niner. Weapons are hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.90,1:52:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待攻击指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target acquired. Waiting your orders to engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.50,1:52:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 等待攻击指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, waiting your orders to engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.30,1:52:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开火 等候指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command code yellow. Hold for authorization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.20,1:52:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.20,1:52:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官下令停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is T-bolt to all assets. You ha direct orders to hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.70,1:52:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重覆 停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.30,1:52:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,九分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echo, One-niner. Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.70,1:52:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go go, go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.60,1:53:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到我命令 停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire until my command.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.20,1:53:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙儿蹲下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engine 24 to command. We are in position now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.10,1:54:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.10,1:54:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不难找\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't that hard to find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.50,1:54:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很难找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.00,1:55:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.70,1:56:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听好了 他要留在基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}That 's the deal, gentlemen. He stays on this base…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.10,1:56:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我接到命令再处置他\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we get the final word from C-3 on how to dispose of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.40,1:56:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他敢轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, ifhe does anything but sit there in that chair, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.40,1:56:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就开启电源把他烧焦\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna turn on the juice and he'll be incinerated immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.60,1:56:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立两百码的保护范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've established a 200-yard perimeter, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.50,1:56:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是启动电磁波 应该不会伤及无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we deploy the electromagnetic array, there should be no collateral damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.30,1:56:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.20,1:56:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了你才这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doin' this for you, Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.80,1:56:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们要有最坏的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one way or another, we're gonna have to prepare for the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.10,1:58:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have killed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.30,1:58:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也早该杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I should have killed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.50,1:58:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.10,1:59:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚看到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw her last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.70,1:59:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到她的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw her face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.20,1:59:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,棕发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brown hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.00,1:59:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,棕眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brown eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.60,1:59:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对我笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She smiled at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.50,1:59:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,低下头亲我的脸颊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She reached down and kissed my cheek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.60,1:59:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎能闻到她的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can almost remember a smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.10,1:59:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像沙漠花朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost like desert flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.00,1:59:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最爱擦的香水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her favorite perfume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.50,1:59:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连我妈妈的名字都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my mother, and I don't even know her name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.60,1:59:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 尽管哭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, son. You go ahead and cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.50,2:00:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大声地哭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead and cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.20,2:00:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭一哭对你也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cry. Crying will do you good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.80,2:00:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.00,2:00:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你以前是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe once you were my father, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.90,2:00:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在和以后都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're not now and you never will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.60,2:00:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is that so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.30,2:00:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我告诉你 我不是来见你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got news for you. I didn't come here to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.10,2:00:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来见我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here to see my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.50,2:00:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真正的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My real son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.70,2:00:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你体内的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one inside of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.30,2:00:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只不过是一个空壳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing but a superficial shell, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.40,2:00:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你薄弱的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}a husk of flimsy consciousness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.70,2:00:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一瞬间就会消失殆尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}ready to be torn off at a moment's notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.90,2:00:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你 我不在乎 快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can think what you like. I don't care.Just go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.50,2:01:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我找到解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, son. Listen to me. I found a cure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.10,2:01:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,治好我的解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.50,2:01:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的细胞也能突变\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cells can transform too, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.30,2:01:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸收大量的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}absorb enormous amounts of energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.20,2:01:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是却不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, unlike you, they're unstable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.00,2:01:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 我需要你的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, I need your strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.10,2:01:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赐给你生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.40,2:01:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该给我回报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you must give it back to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.30,2:01:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比以往强大一百万倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a million times more radiant, more powerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.60,2:01:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住手 - 为什么住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it. - Stop? Stop what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.80,2:01:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.00,2:01:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想想外面那些穿军服的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about all those men out there in their uniforms…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.30,2:01:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会盲目地服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}barking and swallowing orders, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.40,2:01:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,以武力统治全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}inflicting their petty rule over the entire globe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.30,2:01:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们造成了多大的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of all the harm they've done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.70,2:01:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你！对我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you! To me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.80,2:01:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对全人类！\N{\fnArial\fs30}To humanity!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.10,2:01:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以让他们的国旗国歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And know this… that we can make them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.10,2:02:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们的政府永远消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their flags and their anthems and their governments… disappear in a flash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.60,2:02:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你我合而为一\N{\fnArial\fs30}You in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.20,2:02:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死也不肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.10,2:02:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的回答？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that 's your answer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.00,2:02:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你真的应该死后重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then indeed you shall die… and be reborn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.10,2:02:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为在文明污染人类灵魂之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hero… of the kind that walked the earth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.60,2:02:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,傲视地球的英雄人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}long before the pale religions of civilization… infected humanity's soul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.10,2:02:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.30,2:02:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop your bawling, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.30,2:02:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这没有用的人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}you weak little speck of human trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.20,2:03:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right… I'll go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.80,2:03:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就看着我走吧 - 通电\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just watch me go! - Hit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.20,2:03:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.40,2:03:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 没电了 有一股逆向电磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't, sir. There's no power. Some kind of counter-electromagnetic field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.80,2:03:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁目标 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move in and assault the target. Move in.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.30,2:03:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.10,2:04:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他们 在梨子湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I've located them on radar. Pear Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.70,2:04:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知伽玛弹小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call up the task force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.70,2:04:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.60,2:05:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 继续抗拒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Keep fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.50,2:06:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越抗拒我吸收的能量就越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more you fight, the more of you I take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.60,2:06:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪 温度急速下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange. We're reading a phenomenal drop in temperatures there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.50,2:06:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时有放射性活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}But simultaneous radiological activity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.20,2:06:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在吸收周围的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're absorbing all the ambient energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.70,2:06:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉睡吧 遗忘一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep now, Bruce, and forget forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.10,2:06:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再挣扎了 把力量全都给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Struggle no more… and give me all of your power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.80,2:06:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你承受得了就拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can live with it? Take it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.90,2:06:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.60,2:06:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.10,2:07:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.50,2:07:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,停不下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not stopping!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.90,2:07:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.70,2:07:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 发射伽玛弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen… release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.20,2:07:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射伽玛弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gamma charge away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.40,2:08:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 祝好梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mwah! - Sweet dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.70,2:08:34.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一年后）
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.50,2:09:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂？是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Betty, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.80,2:09:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 爸 很高兴找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dad. I'm gl I caught you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.10,2:09:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你打来 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gl you called. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.20,2:09:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝蒂 你跟我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Betty… you and I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.60,2:09:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道布鲁斯活不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, we both know that Bruce couldn't have survived that blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.00,2:09:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过要是你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… well, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.20,2:09:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? Well, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.20,2:09:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道 世上有很多疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual loonies. Seein' things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:36.20,2:09:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到处都看到绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only now everything's green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.80,2:09:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.50,2:09:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.50,2:09:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他真的没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}if by some chance he did survive…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.20,2:09:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他试着跟你联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he should try to contact you, try to get in touch, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.00,2:09:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会告诉我吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd tell me, wouldn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.80,2:10:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No… I wouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.70,2:10:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know as well as I do, I wouldn't have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.40,2:10:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的电话被窃听电脑被监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, my phones are bugged, my computer's tapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.00,2:10:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一举一动都被监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm under surveillance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.30,2:10:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you, though, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.10,2:10:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if he were alive, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.10,2:10:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最不希望他来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the last person I would want him to come to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.40,2:10:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我很想他\N{\fnArial\fs30}because… as much as I miss him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.90,2:10:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我也很爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I…. loved him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.50,2:10:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Betty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.20,2:10:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.20,2:10:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.10,2:11:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听爸爸的话乖乖吃药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to your father and take your medicine, ok?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.30,2:11:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把药都拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.30,2:11:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.80,2:11:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:46.00,2:11:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.00,2:11:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些药是给当地居民的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need these medicines for the people who live here.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.10,2:11:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂个什么屁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you to decide what the people need?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.40,2:12:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在帮助敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are helping our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.10,2:12:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe you are too.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.20,2:12:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,通通拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take all this.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:07.00,2:12:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这全是政府的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the property of the government.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.00,2:12:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹我生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making me angry.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:15.80,2:12:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我生气 你不会喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't like me when I'm angry.
